  unitName: Thunder Champion Rahgan
  unitId: 40666
  unitNumber: 1149
  description: An instructor of the Toltya School of Martial Arts. The last time
    Rahgan ever fought was against the God Army troops which sought to destroy those
    fleeing towards the new promised land. He had grown so powerful after his recovery
    that his pupils thought he had beaten death itself. However, when he vomited
    blood on the battlefield, they soon realized otherwise. The God Army saw this
    as an opening to attack him full force, but Rahgan's strength was such that he
    stood right back up and did not stop fighting until every god around him had
    been pulverized.
  summonDesc: I do not fear death.<br>I just want to protect<br>those precious to
    me.<br>That's what really scares me.
  fusionDesc: '*Cough* *cough* *gasp*<br>What...?<br>Don''t make such a fuss<br>over
    a little blood!'
  evoDesc: My time is here!<br>Curse this short life of mine!<br>You shall hear the
    Thunderbird roar!
  element: 4
  rarity: 6
